00:09:27.366 --> 00:09:28.970
- No, it's...
- Mm!


00:09:29.068 --> 00:09:31.742
Yeah.


00:09:31.871 --> 00:09:33.578
Hmm.


00:09:33.706 --> 00:09:34.684
You're pretty.


