00:10:08.641 --> 00:10:11.053
Yeah, I mean, and that's
very accurate of them. I am.


00:10:11.143 --> 00:10:13.214
But, you, on the other hand,
you could be...


00:10:13.312 --> 00:10:15.019
What <i>is...</i> Come on!


00:10:20.219 --> 00:10:21.425
- Good afternoon.
- Afternoon.


00:10:21.554 --> 00:10:24.057
- Anything to declare?
- No.


00:10:24.156 --> 00:10:26.102
- No.
- Go ahead.


00:10:26.225 --> 00:10:28.136
Oh, hey. Yeah.
It's fine.


00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:31.366
Thanks. Thanks.


00:10:31.464 --> 00:10:33.808
And thanks for coming, by the way.


00:10:33.933 --> 00:10:35.776
