00:11:34.393 --> 00:11:35.701
Oh!


00:11:38.464 --> 00:11:40.808
Um, oh, uh,
what's the name, again?


00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:42.345
- Jacinta.
- Jacinta.


00:11:42.435 --> 00:11:44.346
Yeah, your grandmother's name
was Jacinta.


00:11:44.437 --> 00:11:46.178
- Uh-huh.
- And she was born in Sonora.


00:11:46.272 --> 00:11:47.717
- Sonora.
- And she... Oh! Okay.


